{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_115_1000_022ser", "source_sha256": "96bf4ff1ce4ce6d1b8342733f3e33040bce6a979414464c993902401b0e703ff", "ja": "春香さん、千鶴さん。\n今度わたしの家で、パパのお客様を\n招いて、お茶会をするんです。", "zh": "春香小姐、千鶴小姐。\n下次我家里要招待爸爸的客人，\n举办一个茶会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_115_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "3021e7428edfba9ec013c6de6102c256c80cb00b0ebec87c7bc005f2de9412d2", "ja": "夏のアフタヌーンティーには、\nどんなお菓子を用意したら\nいいと思いますか？", "zh": "夏天的下午茶，\n你们觉得准备些什么点心\n比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_115_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "65f9f198c21b90a166cdbe4877d9313e6b94b557e08aa1944701af1d2d2865bf", "ja": "夏のアフタヌーンティーかぁ。\n焼き菓子だけだと、ちょっと重い\nから……ゼリーとか、ムースとか？", "zh": "夏日的下午茶啊。\n要是只有烘焙点心的话，会感觉有点发腻\n……果冻呀，慕斯之类的怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_115_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_115_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "963b26415f759eb9d058461c66d22062702a04214e1af0b52f5b8ff001fb858d", "ja": "夏のお茶会、素敵ですわね！\n夏のおもてなしと言えば、\n縁側で麦茶……。", "zh": "夏日的茶会，真是美妙呢！\n说起夏天的款待，\n就是坐在缘侧喝麦茶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
